  "notes": "Palette/scale read from the site's real custom properties (241 tokens) corroborated by screenshots. Three warm 'ground' off-whites (page/page-secondary/sunken) collapsed under color.roles; white is card-only. Single ember accent (ramp 50-800). Separate 'mock' micro-type ramp (10-15px + tabular-nums) kept distinct from the editorial scale because it is a load-bearing idea here. No dark re-theme (supportsDark:false) so color.dark omitted; the dark 'ember' sections are content bands, not a theme. Shadows are near-absent in practice — depth is hairline borders + glass blur. The 2.5s draw is the slow 'string reveal'; other durations are the entrance family."
}
